==District 6==
{{see also|Maryland's 6th congressional district}}
The incumbent is Democrat [[John Delaney (Maryland politician)|John Delaney]], who has represented the district since 2013. Delaney was re-elected with 56% of the vote in 2016.

Delaney is retiring to seek the [[Democratic Party presidential primaries, 2020|Democratic Party's nomination for]] [[President of the United States]] in [[United States presidential election, 2020|2020]].

